These are notes for running the app in a pod or container 


1. create Dockerfile

2. create requirements.txt 

3. create app.py



podman rm -f flask-app
podman build -t flask-app .
podman run -p 5000:5000 --name flask-app flask-app
podman ps 
podman stop <containerid> 
podman start flask-app
podman stop flask-app



